sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant R as OutboxRelay (any node)
    participant K as Kafka
    O->>DB: BEGIN
    O->>DB: UPDATE saga_instances (version+1)
    O->>DB: INSERT outbox_events (PENDING)
    O->>DB: INSERT saga_audit_log
    O->>DB: COMMIT (all or nothing)
    loop every 250 ms
        R->>DB: BEGIN, SELECT * FROM outbox_events<br/>WHERE status='PENDING' ORDER BY id<br/>LIMIT 100 FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
        R->>K: send(topic, key=sagaId, payload) – async batch
        K-->>R: acks=all
        R->>DB: UPDATE status='PUBLISHED. then COMMIT
    end
    Note over R,K: crash between send and commit → redelivery,<br/>absorbed by idempotency (at-least-once, effectively-once)
